== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(einn)|fjörutíu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[einn]]'' "[[one]]". Meaning '''forty and one'''.

=== Cardinal number ===
'''[[tuttugu]] og [[einn]]'''

# [[forty-one]], cardinal number after [[fjörutíu]] and before [[fjörutíu og tveir]]

